{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A long time ago, the orc ancestors messed up by opening a portal to another world, letting demons invade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a tough battle, the demons were kicked out, but the orcs got blamed and became slaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an orc, you can either work forever or fight in the arena to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/1.gif?t=1740127799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features :</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapon Choices:\u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5\u00a0 types of weapons, each with 3 different fighting styles, giving you 15 ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/2.gif?t=1740127799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle Boosts: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 100 boosts that change based on your weapon, giving you special powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/3.gif?t=1740127799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/4.gif?t=1740127799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Challenges: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich map mechanics, randomly combined monster groups, and random negative affixes ensure that every battle experience is unique.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/cyh5.gif?t=1740127799\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3188460?t=1740127799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset